# Expression of Interest (EoI) Development for SeyCCAT

The objective is to draft a comprehensive Expression of Interest (EoI) for the Seychelles Conservation and Climate Adaptation Trust (SeyCCAT) consultancy: "Regulatory and Legislative Assessment for Sustainable Finance Instruments in Seychelles". This conforms to the Terms of Reference found in `Task001` and aligns with the Google Antigravity framework outlined in `bootstrap.md`.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]  
> Please review the proposed approach for the Expression of Interest. Do you have specific background information, past consultancy experience in Seychelles, or team member qualifications (e.g. LLM degrees, 7+ years of experience) that I should include in the draft?

## Proposed Changes

We will generate the required documentation within the `main_management_folder` system as mandated by our `bootstrap.md` framework, and draft the final EoI in the `src/` directory.

